{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "Nearby next-train coach, shared by Kotlin NearbyDepartureCoach and Swift NearbyDepartureCoach. walkMinutes = max(1, ceil(distanceMeters * 1.3 / 80)). Per (line, destination) direction, departures are minutes from now ascending with an isLast flag. case rules in order: stationClosed; noService if empty; if first < walk: no catchable -> missedLast when any listed departure isLast else noService; first catchable isLast -> lastTrain (tight = margin <= 2); wait = catchable - walk, wait <= 8 -> relaxNextOneIsClose else longGapTakeItEasy. If first >= walk: isLast -> lastTrain (tight = margin <= 2); margin <= 2 -> hurry; else comfortable. Headline = index of the direction whose case ranks first in stationClosed > lastTrain > missedLast > relaxNextOneIsClose > hurry > longGapTakeItEasy > comfortable > noService (tie: lowest index; empty -> null). Copy variant = fnv1a32(utf8(stationId + '|' + athensDate yyyy-MM-dd)) mod variantCount. Guards return the first blocking reason in order disabled, goActive, quietHours (hour >= 23 or < 7, Athens), moving (speed > 25 km/h; null speed allowed), cooldown (< 45 min since last for this station), dailyCap (>= 4 today), else allow. Geofence radius 1000 m, dwell 60 s, nearest 20 stations monitored.",
